This product is a fork of COMPL-AI (Apache-2.0), the EU AI Act benchmarking suite by
LatticeFlow AI, ETH Zurich, and INSAIT
(https://compl-ai.org; https://github.com/compl-ai/compl-ai; arXiv:2410.07959).
The original 30 EU benchmarks across nine technical requirements are preserved; the
Brazil-specific benchmarks, the PL 2338/2023 article mappings, and the compliance
reporting layer are added by this project. Please cite the original COMPL-AI work
(see the Citation section in README.md).

Data note
---------
This repository does NOT redistribute license-gated datasets. The fairness benchmark
(bbq_brazil) is original, hand-authored content, anchored only on terms from
SHADES / BiasShades (pt-BR; license-gated, not included) and ToxSyn-PT (CC BY 4.0,
not included); no third-party dataset rows are committed. The COMPL-AI EU task
datasets are downloaded at runtime from their original sources.

